    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly brings to the market this exceptional one bedroom ground floor apartment in a prime position in Harty's Quay, Rochestown.\r\n\r\nEnjoying an enviable waterside lifestyle in this beautifully modernized one-bedroom ground floor apartment, perfectly positioned in one of Rochestown's most desirable waterfront developments. Boasting uninterrupted estuary views and presented in fabulous decorative condition throughout, this exceptional home has been tastefully upgraded by its current owners to create a stylish, contemporary living space ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nThe bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area is flooded with natural light, offering the perfect setting for both relaxing and entertaining. The generous double bedroom provides a peaceful retreat, while the modern bathroom and walk-in wardrobe/dressing room gives excellent storage further enhancing the apartment's practicality and appeal.\r\n\r\nSet within beautifully maintained surroundings, residents can enjoy the tranquility of waterfront living with scenic walks right on the doorstep. Conveniently located just minutes from Douglas Village, Cork City Centre and a host of local amenities, this outstanding apartment perfectly combines coastal charm with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a truly turn-key waterfront home in one of Cork's most sought-after locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \r\nWooden floor, recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room - 6.67m x 3.77m \r\nWooden flooring, media wall surrounded by extensive built-in shelving, TV point, extensive glazing with waterfront views, door to decking area. \r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.98m x 2.0m \r\nGally style kitchen with modern fitted kitchen units, integrated oven, hob, overhead extractor unit, fridge/freezer, dishwasher, recessed lighting, open plan to kitchen/dining area, vertical radiator, roller blind.  \r\n\r\nBedroom - 3.84m x 3.07m \r\nWooden floor, TV and telephone points, centre light, Roman blind, curtain pole. \r\n\r\nWalk-in Wardrobe - \r\nExtensive shelving, wardrobe and storage drawer units. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.16m x 2.04m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, electric shower unit with rainfall shower head and chrome enclosure, WC, WHB with underneath storage press. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 63 sq metres  (677 sq ft)\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nSecure gated development with designated parking\r\nImpeccable condition throughout\r\nSecure gated development \r\nMinutes to all amenities & services in Douglas\r\nEasy access to South Link Road Network\r\nEasy access to public bus service available\r\nShort drive to Cork Airport, Cork City Centre & Ringaskiddy\r\n\r\nManagement Fee: €2,750 per annum (Discounted €250 for early payment)"
      },
